# FFTW 3.3.10 vendored source — autotools/libtool build artifacts only.
# The pristine upstream tree (3500 files) is committed; `./configure && make`
# regenerates everything ignored here (see UPSTREAM.md for the exact configure
# line).  Only exact generated names are ignored so pristine tarball files such
# as api/fftw3l.f03, api/fftw3q.f03 and fftw.pc.in remain tracked.
